      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just like how there is a udon node for legacy locomotion (ew stutterstep) there could be a node to use the new adjustable player collision system.\n\nThat way old worlds with scaling disabled won't have tall avatars not being able to pass through doorframes or get stuck in low ceilings.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
